<Base title="Before Booking a Goa Hotel: 7 Checks | Goa, Considered" description="A practical seven-point Goa hotel checklist for location, beach access, facilities, room terms, transport and comparable prices.">
  <div class="wrap content booking-checklist">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Guides / Before booking</p>
    <p class="kicker">A practical checklist</p>
    <h1>Before booking a Goa hotel: seven things to check</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">Use this list to compare the details that can change how a Goa stay works. Confirm each point for your dates with the property or booking provider; facilities, rates and terms can change.</p>

    <ol class="booking-checks">
      <li>
        <h2>Pin down the exact area</h2>
        <p>Start with the locality, not just “North Goa” or “South Goa.” The shortlist spans places such as Vagator, Nerul, Sinquerim-Candolim, Arossim, Colva and Benaulim. Check what you plan to visit and how you will travel between areas. See the <a href="/guides/best-areas-to-stay-in-goa/">area guide</a>.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Check what “beach access” means</h2>
        <p>Look for direct access, a shuttle, a walk from the property, or simply a nearby beach. For example, ITC Grand Goa lists direct Arossim Beach access, while Alila Diwa Goa lists a shuttle to Gonsua Beach. Confirm the route and current service with the hotel.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Confirm facilities for your travel dates</h2>
        <p>Do not assume a pool, kids’ club, spa, restaurant or shuttle operates every day or through every season. Ask the property about closures, age limits, hours, advance booking and any extra charges. Calangute Residency’s current GTDC listing does not establish pool operating status.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Read the room and meal inclusions</h2>
        <p>Compare the exact room category, occupancy, breakfast or other meals, taxes, extra-person charges and any accessibility needs. A general hotel description may not apply to every room type.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Plan airport and local transport</h2>
        <p>Check the airport, transfer options, pickup arrangements and how you will make local trips. Avoid relying on a generic state-wide travel time; route and traffic vary with the exact start, destination and date.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Compare cancellation and payment terms</h2>
        <p>Read the cancellation deadline, deposit and refund conditions on the specific rate you are considering. Policies can differ by room, dates and booking channel, so check the terms shown at checkout.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>Compare total prices on the same basis</h2>
        <p>Use matching dates, number of guests, room type, meal plan, currency, taxes and cancellation terms. Goa hotel rates vary by season and availability; this directory does not show live prices or claim which option is cheapest.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="callout"><strong>Before you pay:</strong> revisit the hotel’s official page and the final booking terms. This checklist is a planning aid, not a confirmation that a listed facility or rate is available.</div>
    <p>Compare location and listed facilities in the <a href="/compare/">Goa hotel comparison</a>, then browse the <a href="/#hotel-selection">hotel profiles</a> and follow a property’s official link for current details.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
